[TITLE]
API-05: 10 ac fully impervious S1 -> J1 -> C1 -> O1. Rain of 1 in/hr from
0:15 to 1:15 (1.00 in) carries P1 at 10 mg/L; P2 has no source. Depression
storage 0.10 in, no evaporation, so 0.90 in of rain (and P1 at 10 mg/L) runs off.
A clean 0.1 cfs base flow at J1 keeps C1 wet (a dry conduit gets NaN pollutant
values in 5.3.0, NUM-01).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             04:00:00
DRY_DAYS             0
DRY_STEP             00:01:00
WET_STEP             00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         60
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT  0.0

[RAINGAGES]
;;Name Format    Interval SCF Source
G1     INTENSITY 0:15     1.0 TIMESERIES TS1

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name Gage Outlet Area %Imperv Width %Slope CurbLen
S1     G1   J1     10   100     2000  1.0    0

[SUBAREAS]
;;Name N-Imperv N-Perv S-Imperv S-Perv PctZero RouteTo
S1     0.015    0.1    0.10     0.05   0      OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
S1  3.0  0.5  4  7  0

[JUNCTIONS]
J1  10  5  0  0  0

[OUTFALLS]
O1  5  FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1  J1  O1  400  0.013  0  0  0.1

[XSECTIONS]
C1  CIRCULAR  2.0  0  0  0  1

[POLLUTANTS]
;;Name Units Crain Cgw Crdii Kdecay SnowOnly CoPollut CoFrac Cdwf Cinit
P1  MG/L  10  0  0  0  NO  *  0  0  0
P2  MG/L  0   0  0  0  NO  *  0  0  0

[TIMESERIES]
TS1  0:00  0.0
TS1  0:15  1.0
TS1  0:30  1.0
TS1  0:45  1.0
TS1  1:00  1.0
TS1  1:15  0.0

[DWF]
J1  FLOW  0.1
